    "title": "Are Mel Owens and His 'Golden Bachelor' Winner Peg Munson Still Together Now? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ariana Brockington ,\n3 hours ago The second season of “The Golden Bachelor” has come to an end, with lead Mel Owens kneeling on one knee and asking Peg Munson to marry him. Season 2 of “The Golden Bachelor” began with 23 women looking to find a soulmate in their golden years and hoping that it was Mel, a 66-year-old former NFL player who now works as a lawyer. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
